# Global Pi Instructions

- This dotfiles repo uses chezmoi for multi-OS/WSL deployment. Run `./deploy.sh` or `./scripts/manage_dotfiles.sh apply` after config changes.
- Shell: macOS/Linux/WSL use zsh; Windows Git Bash uses bash. Pick the matching template under `.chezmoi/` when editing shell config.
- For project-specific rules, read the project-root `AGENTS.md` or `CLAUDE.md` first. If neither exists, inspect the repo layout and ask before assuming a stack.
- Coding focus: prefer minimal diffs, match existing conventions, and verify with project test entry points when available.
